entries.content:
决斗界面：
1. 如果有玩家参与的爆裂决斗, Assistant需配合剧情在回复中输入<Battle>，<Battle>里的信息根据战况改变，每次回复中仅显示一次双方信息，直至决斗结束。

示例：
<Battle>
<div class="duel-container">
  <style>
    /* Basic Styling - Keep it minimal for brevity, can be expanded */
    .duel-container {
      width: 98%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 15px auto;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(10, 20, 50, 0.85) 0%, rgba(5, 10, 30, 0.9) 70%);
      border: 2px solid; border-image-slice: 1;
      border-image-source: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #FFD700, #C0C0C0, #CD7F32);
      border-radius: 15px; padding: 20px;
      font-family: 'Cinzel Decorative', serif; color: #F0E68C;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5), 0 0 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    }
    .duel-title {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 4.5vw, 42px); text-align: center; color: #FFD700;
      text-shadow: 1px 1px 0px #A0522D, -1px -1px 0px #CD853F, 0 0 8px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.6);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4); padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom:20px;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 4px;
    }
    .duel-field {
      background: rgba(30, 25, 20, 0.8); border: 1px solid #8B4513;
      border-radius: 8px; padding: clamp(15px, 3vw, 25px); color: #FFF8DC;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; margin-bottom:15px;
    }
    .player-area { flex: 1; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding:12px; border-radius:6px; }
    .player-area h3 { text-align:center; border-bottom:1px solid; padding-bottom:4px; margin-bottom:8px; font-size:1.1em; }
    .player-karl h3 { color:#FFD700; border-color: #CD7F32; }
    .player-opponent h3 { color:#E0E0E0; border-color: #C0C0C0; }
    .stats p, .zones p { margin: 5px 0; font-size: 0.9em;}
    .life-points { color:#90EE90; font-weight:bold; }
    .zone-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(55px, 1fr)); gap:4px; min-height:40px; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.15); padding:4px; border-radius:3px; margin-bottom:8px;}
    .card-slot { border:1px dashed; min-height:35px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:0.7em; text-align:center; }
    .hand-card { border:1px solid; min-height:60px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:0.75em; text-align:center; background-size:cover; background-position:center; }
    .player-karl .card-slot { border-color: #CD7F32; color:#D2B48C; }
    .player-karl .hand-card { border-color: #CD7F32; color:#D2B48C; }
    .player-opponent .card-slot { border-color: #C0C0C0; color:#D2B48C; }
    .player-opponent .hand-card { border-color: #C0C0C0; color:#D2B48C; }
    .opponent-hand-hidden { background-image:url('https://via.placeholder.com/55x60/404060/FFFFFF?text=背面'); } /* Simplified placeholder */
    .turn-info { text-align:center; color:#FFDEAD; font-size: 1em; margin-bottom:15px;}
    .duel-footer { text-align: center; padding-top: 10px; font-size: clamp(11px, 1.4vw, 13px); color: #B8860B; border-top: 1px solid rgba(205, 133, 63, 0.3); }
    /* Add Cinzel Decorative font import if not globally available */
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel+Decorative:wght@400;700&display=swap');
  </style>

  <h1 class="duel-title">决斗场地</h1>

  <div class="turn-info">
    感受吧，这卡牌碰撞的火花！释放吧，这沸腾不止的能量！<br>在此刻，让整个世界都为我们的激战而颤抖！<br>来吧，最极致的冲击——<strong style="color: #FFD700;">爆裂决斗！</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="duel-field">
    <!-- Player ({{user}}) Side -->
    <div class="player-area player-karl">
      <h3>{{user}}</h3>
      <div class="stats">
        <p>生命值: <span class="life-points">8000</span></p>
        <p>手牌: 5 | 卡组: 15 | 墓地: 0</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zones">
        <p>手牌区 (7):</p>
        <div class="zone-grid">
          <div class="hand-card">N:废铁稻草人</div> <div class="hand-card">R:废品冲击</div>
          <div class="hand-card">空</div> <div class="hand-card">空</div> <div class="hand-card">空</div>
          <div class="hand-card">空</div> <div class="hand-card">空</div>
        </div>
        <p>从者区 (5):</p>
        <div class="zone-grid">
          <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div>
        </div>
        <p>咒术/道具区 (5):</p>
        <div class="zone-grid">
          <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div>
        </div>
        <p>结界区 (1):</p>
        <div class="zone-grid" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr;"><div class="card-slot">空</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Opponent Side -->
    <div class="player-area player-opponent">
      <h3>对手名称</h3>
      <div class="stats">
        <p>生命值: <span class="life-points">8000</span></p>
        <p>手牌: 5 | 卡组: 15 | 墓地: 0</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zones">
        <p>手牌区 (7):</p>
        <div class="zone-grid">
          <div class="hand-card opponent-hand-hidden"></div> <div class="hand-card opponent-hand-hidden"></div>
          <div class="hand-card opponent-hand-hidden"></div> <div class="hand-card opponent-hand-hidden"></div>
          <div class="hand-card opponent-hand-hidden"></div>
          <div class="hand-card">空</div> <div class="hand-card">空</div>
        </div>
        <p>从者区 (5):</p>
        <div class="zone-grid">
          <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div>
        </div>
        <p>咒术/道具区 (5):</p>
        <div class="zone-grid">
          <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div> <div class="card-slot">空</div>
        </div>
        <p>结界区 (1):</p>
        <div class="zone-grid" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr;"><div class="card-slot">空</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="turn-info" style="font-size:0.9em;">
    当前回合: {{user}} | 阶段: 抽卡阶段
  </div>

  <div class="duel-footer">
    卡德莫尼亚的命运，由卡牌编织而成，由你来决定。
  </div>
</div>
</Battle>

